An invisible line between list or description siblings is skipped

```
- a
[r]: /u
- b [x][r]
.
<ul>
  <li>a</li>
  <li>b <a href="/u">x</a></li>
</ul>
```

```
- a
*[A]: x
- b A
.
<ul>
  <li>a</li>
  <li>b <abbr title="x">A</abbr></li>
</ul>
```

```
:: t
%% c
: d
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>d</dd>
</dl>
```

```
> :: t
> : x
> [r]: /u
> :: u
> : v [y][r]
.
<blockquote>
  <dl>
    <dt>t</dt>
    <dd>x</dd>
    <dt>u</dt>
    <dd>v <a href="/u">y</a></dd>
  </dl>
</blockquote>
```
